-## The postal card and the missing side
+Within ZOB-320's printed numbers, the **4B** entry reported provided to AAT-20 ends at **1650**, and the next **4B** interval reported secured at ZOB begins at **1650**. The first **4B** interval ends at **1333**, and the next begins at **1344**. The first **4A** interval **1332-1344** spans the numeric interval between those labels. Similarly, the two **7B** rows end at **1650** and begin at **1700**, and the **7A** row **1644-1707** spans the printed interval between them. This is a comparison of labels. A track-to-position register and calibrated playback would be needed to test whether the corresponding physical recordings actually cover the same channels and times. [Full row transcription, numeric comparisons and source locators](SOURCE-PINS.json)
 
